/**
 * Hand-drawn kitchen doodles scattered across the whole menu background: knives, bread,
 * veggies, pans and friends at mixed sizes and tilts. Purely decorative.
 *
 * The layer spans the full viewport width (the page content is w-5/6, so -10% on each side
 * reaches the edges) and clips its children, so nothing can poke past the screen.
 * Placement is a jittered grid from a fixed seed: organic-looking, but identical on every visit.
 */

